1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,940
Place the welding wire.

2
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:08,340
Now we replace the 1 millimeter welding wire with a 1.2 millimeter welding wire.

3
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:13,740
Open the door of the wire feeder, unscrew the cap, and remove the sleeve.

4
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:16,660
Open the two tensioners.

5
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:22,900
Rotate the wire spool clockwise to remove the wire from the wire feeding driver.

6
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:25,400
Take out the wire spool.

7
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:30,800
Bend the wire end and store it in the hole of the wire spool.

8
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:33,800
Remove the screws.

9
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,080
Remove the current drive rolls.

10
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:38,720
Remove the screws above the wire feeding driver.

11
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:42,840
Take out the drive rolls stored above the wire feeding driver.

12
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:45,900
Ensure that the size on the outer side of the drive rolls

13
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:48,120
matches the welding wire's diameter.

14
00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:51,620
Install the new pair of drive rolls.

15
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:54,320
Install the screws back.

16
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:59,040
Store the other pair of drive rolls above the wire feeding driver.

17
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:06,360
Replace the 0.8 slash 1.0 nozzle with a provided 1.2 slash 1.6 wire feeding

18
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:09,370
nozzle.

19
00:01:09,370 --> 00:01:12,410
Install the new wire spool.

20
00:01:12,410 --> 00:01:13,850
Install the sleeve back.

21
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:17,360
Install the cap back.

22
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:19,600
Take out the wire end.

23
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:22,280
Cut off the bent end of the wire.

24
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:25,800
Thread the wire into the wire feeding driver.

25
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:30,520
Press the wire slightly to make it pass through.

26
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:36,100
Close the tensioners.

27
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:42,050
Rotate the tensioners knobs to adjust the wire feed tension.

28
00:01:42,050 --> 00:01:44,930
Press and hold the feed button on the wire feeder

29
00:01:44,930 --> 00:01:48,050
until the wire extends out from the nozzle.
